- `software-engineer-reviewer`
- `product-manager-reviewer`
- `designer-reviewer`
- `tester-reviewer`
- `security-expert-reviewer`
- `marketing-expert-reviewer`
- `data-scientist-reviewer`

The dispatcher will prefer named subagents over generic + explicit role briefs when both are available.

